  "notes": [
    "Irregular -AR verb with an *o→ue* stem change (same pattern as *contar*, *recordar*): the stressed *o* becomes *ue* everywhere except nosotros/nosotras and the Pretérito Indefinido/Imperfecto/Futuro/Condicional, which stay fully regular",
    "Past participle: *acordado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to agree (on)\" or \"to decide (together)\" — *acordaron el precio* (they agreed on the price), *acordamos reunirnos el lunes* (we agreed to meet on Monday)",
    "Not to be confused with its reflexive counterpart *acordarse* (\"to remember\"), which has the same stem change but a completely different meaning — see `Acordarse.md`",
    "Related: *acuerdo* (agreement, noun — *de acuerdo* = agreed/OK), *acordado/a* (agreed upon), *desacuerdo* (disagreement)"
  ],
  "sourceFile": "Verbs/a/Acordar.md"
